ing/tools/index.html?CDC_AA_refVal=https%3a%2f%2fwww.cdc.gov%2fniosh%2fmining%2fworks%2fproductlist.html","why":"iOS uses this icon for home-screen bookmarks and \"Add to Home Screen\" — without it the icon falls back to a screenshot."},{"id":"manifest-parsed","label":"Manifest fetched and parsed successfully","status":"pass","evidence":"display=standalone, start_url=unset","exampleUrl":"https://www.cdc.gov/niosh/mining/tools/index.html?CDC_AA_refVal=https%3a%2f%2fwww.cdc.gov%2fniosh%2fmining%2fworks%2fproductlist.html","why":"A manifest that fails to parse cannot drive installability or launch behavior even if the link is present."},{"id":"manifest-maskable-icon","label":"Manifest declares a maskable icon","status":"fail","evidence":"No icon with purpose \"maskable\"","exampleUrl":"https://www.cdc.gov/niosh/mining/tools/index.html?CDC_AA_refVal=https%3a%2f%2fwww.cdc.gov%2fniosh%2fmining%2fworks%2fproductlist.html","why":"A maskable icon lets the OS safely crop/mask the app icon on different device shapes without clipping content."},{"id":"sw-active","label":"Service worker is active (not just registered)","status":"fail","evidence":"","exampleUrl":"https://www.cdc.gov/niosh/mining/tools/index.html?CDC_AA_refVal=https%3a%2f%2fwww.cdc.gov%2fniosh%2fmining%2fworks%2fproductlist.html","why":"An active service worker (not just registered) is what actually intercepts requests and serves cached content."},{"id":"sw-controlling","label":"Service worker controls this page load","status":"fail","evidence":"","exampleUrl":"https://www.cdc.gov/niosh/mining/tools/index.html?CDC_AA_refVal=https%3a%2f%2fwww.cdc.gov%2fniosh%2fmining%2fworks%2fproductlist.html","why":"A controlling service worker means THIS page load is being served/intercepted, not just a future one."},{"id":"installable","label":"Meets basic installability criteria","status":"fail","evidence":"no service worker registered","exampleUrl":"https://www.cdc.gov/niosh/mining/tools/index.html?CDC_AA_refVal=https%3a%2f%2